#: account/views.py:109
msgid ""
"You can review a seller after contacting them about a listing or buying from "
"them."
msgstr "與賣家聯絡過某則刊登或向其購買後，才能評價這位賣家。"

#: auction/notifications.py:16
msgid ""
"Only ever pay through Reptilian. Never send money directly to a seller: we "
"can only protect payments made through us."
msgstr ""
"請只透過 Reptilian 付款，切勿直接匯款給賣家：我們只能保障透過本站完成的付款。"

#: auction/notifications.py:32
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hand the animal over (or ship it) by %(handover_due)s, then mark it as "
"handed over on the listing page. If it isn't handed over by then, the buyer "
"is refunded in full and it counts against your account."
msgstr ""
"請在 %(handover_due)s 前交貨（或寄出），並在刊登頁面標記為已交貨。若屆時仍未"
"交貨，買家將獲得全額退款，並會記錄在你的帳號上。"

#: auction/notifications.py:33
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hand the item over (or ship it) by %(handover_due)s, then mark it as handed "
"over on the listing page. If it isn't handed over by then, the buyer is "
"refunded in full and it counts against your account."
msgstr ""
"請在 %(handover_due)s 前交貨（或寄出），並在刊登頁面標記為已交貨。若屆時仍未"
"交貨，買家將獲得全額退款，並會記錄在你的帳號上。"

#: auction/notifications.py:49
#, python-format
msgid "Another buyer is also buying \"%(title)s\""
msgstr "另一位買家也正在購買「%(title)s」"

#: auction/notifications.py:50
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Another buyer has also started buying \"%(title)s\" at the buy-now price of "
"%(price)s. Whoever completes payment first gets it. If someone else pays "
"before you, any payment you make is refunded in full."
msgstr ""
"另一位買家也開始以直接購買價 %(price)s 購買「%(title)s」。誰先完成付款，誰就"
"能買到。若他人比你先付款，你支付的任何款項都會全額退還。"

#: auction/notifications.py:54
#, python-format
msgid "Several buyers are buying \"%(title)s\" at your buy-now price"
msgstr "有多位買家正以你的直接購買價購買「%(title)s」"

#: auction/notifications.py:57
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)s buyers are paying your buy-now price of %(price)s for "
"\"%(title)s\" right now. The first payment to arrive wins and closes the "
"auction; anyone who pays after is refunded in full. You don't need to do "
"anything. If you have more than one of these animals, you can reach the "
"other buyers after the sale."
msgstr ""
"目前有 %(count)s 位買家正以你的直接購買價 %(price)s 購買「%(title)s」。最先完"
"成付款者得標，競標隨即結束；之後才付款的人將全額退款。你不需要做任何事。若你"
"有不只一隻相同的個體，可在成交後再聯繫其他買家。"

#: auction/notifications.py:58
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)s buyers are paying your buy-now price of %(price)s for "
"\"%(title)s\" right now. The first payment to arrive wins and closes the "
"auction; anyone who pays after is refunded in full. You don't need to do "
"anything. If you have more than one of these items, you can reach the other "
"buyers after the sale."
msgstr ""
"目前有 %(count)s 位買家正以你的直接購買價 %(price)s 購買「%(title)s」。最先完"
"成付款者得標，競標隨即結束；之後才付款的人將全額退款。你不需要做任何事。若你"
"有不只一件相同的物品，可在成交後再聯繫其他買家。"

#: auction/notifications.py:70
#, python-format
msgid "You bought \"%(title)s\""
msgstr "你已購得「%(title)s」"

#: auction/notifications.py:73
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your payment of %(paid)s for \"%(title)s\" has arrived, so the animal is "
"yours and the auction has closed. We hold your payment until you have "
"received the animal, and only then pay the seller."
msgstr ""
"我們已收到你為「%(title)s」支付的 %(paid)s，這隻個體歸你所有，競標也已結束。"
"我們會代為保管款項，直到你收到個體後才撥款給賣家。"

#: auction/notifications.py:74
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your payment of %(paid)s for \"%(title)s\" has arrived, so the item is yours "
"and the auction has closed. We hold your payment until you have received the "
"item, and only then pay the seller."
msgstr ""
"我們已收到你為「%(title)s」支付的 %(paid)s，這件物品歸你所有，競標也已結束。"
"我們會代為保管款項，直到你收到物品後才撥款給賣家。"

#: auction/notifications.py:76
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The seller has until %(handover_due)s to hand it over or ship it. If they "
"don't, you get a full refund."
msgstr "賣家必須在 %(handover_due)s 前交貨或寄出；若未完成，你將獲得全額退款。"

#: auction/notifications.py:77 auction/notifications.py:137
msgid "The seller's contact details, to arrange the handover:"
msgstr "賣家的聯絡方式（請與賣家安排交貨）："

#: auction/notifications.py:81
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(title)s\" was bought at your buy-now price"
msgstr "「%(title)s」已以你的直接購買價售出"

#: auction/notifications.py:84
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A buyer paid your buy-now price of %(paid)s for \"%(title)s\", so the "
"auction has closed and every bidder's deposit is being refunded. We hold the "
"payment and pay you once the animal has been handed over."
msgstr ""
"有買家以你的直接購買價 %(paid)s 購買了「%(title)s」，因此競標已結束，所有出價"
"者的保證金將會退還。我們會代為保管款項，並在個體完成交貨後撥款給你。"

#: auction/notifications.py:85
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A buyer paid your buy-now price of %(paid)s for \"%(title)s\", so the "
"auction has closed and every bidder's deposit is being refunded. We hold the "
"payment and pay you once the item has been handed over."
msgstr ""
"有買家以你的直接購買價 %(paid)s 購買了「%(title)s」，因此競標已結束，所有出價"
"者的保證金將會退還。我們會代為保管款項，並在物品完成交貨後撥款給你。"

#: auction/notifications.py:88 auction/notifications.py:147
msgid "The buyer's contact details, to arrange the handover:"
msgstr "買家的聯絡方式（請與買家安排交貨）："

#: auction/notifications.py:93
#, python-format
msgid "The auction for \"%(title)s\" has closed early"
msgstr "「%(title)s」的競標已提前結束"

#: auction/notifications.py:94
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Another buyer paid the seller's buy-now price for \"%(title)s\", so the "
"auction closed early and no bids can win it. Your deposit of %(deposit)s is "
"being refunded in full."
msgstr ""
"另一位買家以賣家的直接購買價買下了「%(title)s」，因此競標已提前結束，所有出價"
"皆無法得標。你的保證金 %(deposit)s 將會全額退還。"

#: auction/notifications.py:98
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(title)s\" has been bought by someone else"
msgstr "「%(title)s」已被其他買家買走"

#: auction/notifications.py:99
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Another buyer completed payment for \"%(title)s\" first, so it is no longer "
"available. If you still complete a payment, it will be refunded to you in "
"full."
msgstr ""
"另一位買家已先完成「%(title)s」的付款，因此已無法購買。若你仍完成付款，款項將"
"全額退還給你。"

#: auction/notifications.py:107 auction/notifications.py:177
#, python-format
msgid "Your payment for \"%(title)s\" is being refunded"
msgstr "你為「%(title)s」支付的款項將會退還"

#: auction/notifications.py:108
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your payment of %(paid)s for \"%(title)s\" arrived after the auction had "
"closed (another buyer paid first, or it ended). It is being refunded to you "
"in full."
msgstr ""
"你為「%(title)s」支付的 %(paid)s 在競標結束後才入帳（其他買家已先付款，或競標"
"已結束），款項將全額退還給你。"

#: auction/notifications.py:135
#, python-format
msgid "You won \"%(title)s\""
msgstr "你已得標「%(title)s」"

#: auction/notifications.py:136
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You won \"%(title)s\" with a bid of %(price)s. Please pay the remaining "
"%(balance)s through Reptilian by %(payment_due)s (your deposit counts toward "
"the price). If you don't pay in time, your deposit is kept and the sale is "
"cancelled."
msgstr ""
"你以 %(price)s 得標「%(title)s」。請在 %(payment_due)s 前透過 Reptilian 支付剩餘"
"的 %(balance)s（保證金會抵扣價款）。若未在期限內付款，保證金將不予退還，交易"
"也會取消。"

#: auction/notifications.py:141
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(title)s\" sold for %(price)s"
msgstr "「%(title)s」以 %(price)s 成交"

#: auction/notifications.py:144
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your auction for \"%(title)s\" ended with a winning bid of %(price)s. The "
"winner has until %(payment_due)s to pay us the rest; we'll email you as soon "
"as they do, and only then should you hand the animal over."
msgstr ""
"你的「%(title)s」競標已結束，得標價為 %(price)s。得標者必須在 "
"%(payment_due)s 前付清餘款；對方付款後我們會立即通知你，請在那之後才交貨。"

#: auction/notifications.py:145
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your auction for \"%(title)s\" ended with a winning bid of %(price)s. The "
"winner has until %(payment_due)s to pay us the rest; we'll email you as soon "
"as they do, and only then should you hand the item over."
msgstr ""
"你的「%(title)s」競標已結束，得標價為 %(price)s。得標者必須在 "
"%(payment_due)s 前付清餘款；對方付款後我們會立即通知你，請在那之後才交貨。"

#: auction/notifications.py:152
#, python-format
msgid "The auction for \"%(title)s\" has ended"
msgstr "「%(title)s」的競標已結束"

#: auction/notifications.py:153
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The auction for \"%(title)s\" has ended and another bidder won. Your deposit "
"of %(deposit)s is being refunded in full."
msgstr ""
"「%(title)s」的競標已結束，由其他出價者得標。你的保證金 %(deposit)s 將全額退"
"還。"

#: auction/notifications.py:160
#, python-format
msgid "Payment received for \"%(title)s\": please hand it over"
msgstr "已收到「%(title)s」的款項：請交貨"

#: auction/notifications.py:161
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The buyer has paid the full price of %(price)s for \"%(title)s\", and we are "
"holding it."
msgstr "買家已付清「%(title)s」的全額 %(price)s，款項由我們代為保管。"

#: auction/notifications.py:165
#, python-format
msgid "Payment received for \"%(title)s\""
msgstr "已收到「%(title)s」的款項"

#: auction/notifications.py:168
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We have received your payment for \"%(title)s\" and are holding it until you "
"have the animal. The seller has until %(handover_due)s to hand it over or "
"ship it; if they don't, you get a full refund."
msgstr ""
"我們已收到你為「%(title)s」支付的款項，會代為保管直到你收到個體。賣家必須在 "
"%(handover_due)s 前交貨或寄出；若未完成，你將獲得全額退款。"

#: auction/notifications.py:169
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We have received your payment for \"%(title)s\" and are holding it until you "
"have the item. The seller has until %(handover_due)s to hand it over or ship "
"it; if they don't, you get a full refund."
msgstr ""
"我們已收到你為「%(title)s」支付的款項，會代為保管直到你收到物品。賣家必須在 "
"%(handover_due)s 前交貨或寄出；若未完成，你將獲得全額退款。"

#: auction/notifications.py:178
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your payment for \"%(title)s\" arrived after the deadline, when the sale had "
"already been cancelled. It is being refunded to you in full."
msgstr ""
"你為「%(title)s」支付的款項在期限過後才入帳，當時交易已取消，款項將全額退還給"
"你。"

#: auction/notifications.py:185
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(title)s\" has been handed over: please confirm"
msgstr "「%(title)s」已交貨：請確認"

#: auction/notifications.py:186
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The seller says \"%(title)s\" has been handed over or shipped. Their note: "
"%(note)s"
msgstr "賣家表示「%(title)s」已交貨或寄出。賣家備註：%(note)s"

#: auction/notifications.py:189
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Once you have the animal and it is healthy, confirm on the listing page by "
"%(confirm_due)s. If something is wrong, report a problem there instead and "
"we will hold the payment while we look into it. If we hear nothing by then, "
"the sale completes and the seller is paid."
msgstr ""
"收到個體並確認健康後，請在 %(confirm_due)s 前到刊登頁面確認。若有問題，請改在"
"該頁面回報問題，我們會在調查期間暫緩撥款。若屆時未收到任何回覆，交易即完成並"
"撥款給賣家。"

#: auction/notifications.py:190
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Once you have the item and it is as described, confirm on the listing page "
"by %(confirm_due)s. If something is wrong, report a problem there instead "
"and we will hold the payment while we look into it. If we hear nothing by "
"then, the sale completes and the seller is paid."
msgstr ""
"收到物品並確認與描述相符後，請在 %(confirm_due)s 前到刊登頁面確認。若有問題，"
"請改在該頁面回報問題，我們會在調查期間暫緩撥款。若屆時未收到任何回覆，交易即"
"完成並撥款給賣家。"

#: auction/notifications.py:198 auction/notifications.py:202
#, python-format
msgid "Sale completed: \"%(title)s\""
msgstr "交易完成：「%(title)s」"

#: auction/notifications.py:199
#, python-format
msgid "The sale of \"%(title)s\" is complete. We will pay you %(payout)s."
msgstr "「%(title)s」的交易已完成，我們將撥款 %(payout)s 給你。"

#: auction/notifications.py:205
#, python-format
msgid "The sale of \"%(title)s\" is complete. Enjoy your new animal!"
msgstr "「%(title)s」的交易已完成，祝你和新夥伴相處愉快！"

#: auction/notifications.py:206
#, python-format
msgid "The sale of \"%(title)s\" is complete. Enjoy!"
msgstr "「%(title)s」的交易已完成，祝你使用愉快！"

#: auction/notifications.py:214
#, python-format
msgid "The buyer reported a problem with \"%(title)s\""
msgstr "買家回報「%(title)s」有問題"

#: auction/notifications.py:215
#, python-format
msgid "The buyer reported a problem with \"%(title)s\": %(problem)s"
msgstr "買家回報「%(title)s」有問題：%(problem)s"

#: auction/notifications.py:216
msgid ""
"We are holding the payment while our team looks into it, and may contact you."
msgstr "調查期間我們會暫緩撥款，並可能與你聯繫。"

#: auction/notifications.py:224
#, python-format
msgid "Order for \"%(title)s\" refunded"
msgstr "「%(title)s」的訂單已退款"

#: auction/notifications.py:225
#, python-format
msgid ""
"After reviewing the problem reported with \"%(title)s\", we have refunded "
"the buyer in full."
msgstr "經審查「%(title)s」的問題回報後，我們已全額退款給買家。"

#: auction/notifications.py:232
#, python-format
msgid "Your purchase of \"%(title)s\" was cancelled"
msgstr "你購買「%(title)s」的交易已取消"

#: auction/notifications.py:233
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We did not receive the rest of the payment for \"%(title)s\" by "
"%(payment_due)s, so the sale is cancelled and your deposit of %(deposit)s is "
"kept."
msgstr ""
"我們在 %(payment_due)s 前未收到「%(title)s」的餘款，因此交易已取消，你的保證"
"金 %(deposit)s 不予退還。"

#: auction/notifications.py:246
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You can offer \"%(title)s\" to the next-highest bidder at their bid of "
"%(runner_up)s: open the listing page to decide. If you don't want to, you "
"keep the animal."
msgstr ""
"你可以將「%(title)s」以次高出價者的出價 %(runner_up)s 讓給對方：請到刊登頁面"
"決定。若不想這麼做，個體仍歸你所有。"

#: auction/notifications.py:247
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You can offer \"%(title)s\" to the next-highest bidder at their bid of "
"%(runner_up)s: open the listing page to decide. If you don't want to, you "
"keep the item."
msgstr ""
"你可以將「%(title)s」以次高出價者的出價 %(runner_up)s 讓給對方：請到刊登頁面"
"決定。若不想這麼做，物品仍歸你所有。"

#: auction/notifications.py:252
msgid "Nobody else bid on it, so you simply keep the animal."
msgstr "沒有其他人出價，個體仍歸你所有。"

#: auction/notifications.py:253
msgid "Nobody else bid on it, so you simply keep the item."
msgstr "沒有其他人出價，物品仍歸你所有。"

#: auction/notifications.py:256
#, python-format
msgid "The winner of \"%(title)s\" did not pay"
msgstr "「%(title)s」的得標者未付款"

#: auction/notifications.py:259
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The winner of \"%(title)s\" did not pay by the deadline, so the sale is "
"cancelled. Do not hand the animal over."
msgstr "「%(title)s」的得標者未在期限內付款，交易已取消。請勿交貨。"

#: auction/notifications.py:260
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The winner of \"%(title)s\" did not pay by the deadline, so the sale is "
"cancelled. Do not hand the item over."
msgstr "「%(title)s」的得標者未在期限內付款，交易已取消。請勿交貨。"

#: auction/notifications.py:270
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(title)s\" is offered to you"
msgstr "賣家將「%(title)s」讓給你"

#: auction/notifications.py:271
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The winner of \"%(title)s\" did not pay, and the seller is offering it to "
"you at your bid of %(price)s. To buy it, pay on the listing page by "
"%(payment_due)s. You are not obliged to: you can decline or simply let the "
"offer lapse."
msgstr ""
"「%(title)s」的得標者未付款，賣家願意以你的出價 %(price)s 讓給你。若要購買，"
"請在 %(payment_due)s 前到刊登頁面付款。你沒有義務購買，可以婉拒或讓邀請自動失"
"效。"

#: auction/notifications.py:279
#, python-format
msgid "Offer for \"%(title)s\" not taken up"
msgstr "「%(title)s」的讓售邀請未被接受"

#: auction/notifications.py:282
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The next-highest bidder did not take up your offer for \"%(title)s\", so you "
"keep the animal."
msgstr "次高出價者沒有接受「%(title)s」的讓售邀請，個體仍歸你所有。"

#: auction/notifications.py:283
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The next-highest bidder did not take up your offer for \"%(title)s\", so you "
"keep the item."
msgstr "次高出價者沒有接受「%(title)s」的讓售邀請，物品仍歸你所有。"

#: auction/notifications.py:291
#, python-format
msgid "Refund for \"%(title)s\""
msgstr "「%(title)s」退款通知"

#: auction/notifications.py:292
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The seller did not hand over \"%(title)s\" by %(handover_due)s, so we are "
"refunding everything you paid, in full."
msgstr ""
"賣家未在 %(handover_due)s 前交付「%(title)s」，我們將全額退還你支付的所有款"
"項。"

#: auction/notifications.py:297
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your seller bond of %(bond)s has been forfeited; post a new one to keep "
"selling at auction."
msgstr "你的賣家保證金 %(bond)s 已被沒收；若要繼續上架競標，請重新繳交。"

#: auction/notifications.py:299
#, python-format
msgid "Sale of \"%(title)s\" cancelled: not handed over"
msgstr "「%(title)s」交易取消：未交貨"

#: auction/notifications.py:300
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You did not mark \"%(title)s\" as handed over by %(handover_due)s, so the "
"buyer has been refunded in full and this has been recorded on your account."
msgstr ""
"你未在 %(handover_due)s 前將「%(title)s」標記為已交貨，因此買家已獲得全額退"
